							<td width="75%" align="left">
								&nbsp;<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php#1">MASS LINE FORUMS</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?board=3.0">By Any Means</a> / <a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=11.msg45#msg45">Mumia on the Philippines</a>
